    {
      "id": "a_manifest_gives_its_regions_its_page_region_its_routes_and_the_kept_paths_of_a_route_region",
      "label": "the regions and the routes keep the order of the manifest, the page region is the region with page true, and a route region gives its kept paths and those of a kind (HY-2.1, HY-2.4, HY-37)",
